289 0 obj
<<
/Title (We loaded the CSV file into python jupyter notebook, the data has no null values. The time-serise plots shows that all variables are have seasonal patterns. the Mean Sea Level Pressure \(msl\) and Surface Pressure \(sp\) were almost the same, so we dropped the msl.  We created hour, day of week, month, quarter, and year as new features from the  date. Also, we created wind speed and wind direction from u10 and v10 variables  by finding the magnitude between them as the speed as meter/second, and  calculating the direction in degree, clockwise, starting from North=0 using this  equation:)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 265 0 R
/Next 293 0 R
>>
